      "id": "claim_97d75d2ab718456cb48458f4b9a5aecb",
      "statement": "`claudebar update` documents and returns three exit codes: 0 for up to date (or, with --check, the check succeeded), 1 when the check could not run (network/parse error), and 2 when an update is available (only without --check).",
